# Local troubleshooting log

Before treating a local startup, deploy, or environment error as an application bug, read `c:\dev\genkey projects\.cursor\TROUBLESHOOTING.local.md`.

If the symptom matches an existing entry, follow that fix first.

When a new local/runtime issue is diagnosed and fixed, add an entry at the top of that file (do not commit it). Use the template already in the file.
